-- Source module: Solutions.KFWImpl
/-!
# KFW: implementations by a single (uniform) program, parameters in the background

`SImplQ I iprog Q lo hi r st n T U e dw cost`: as `KFN.SImplI`, but

* the code `U` is **one** `IStmt` (not a family indexed by the width);
